function buildFluidSpecimen(container,config={}){if(!physics?.PBFFluid)return;try{const positions=[];const spacing=.17;for(let y=0;y<5;y++)for(let z=0;z<8;z++)for(let x=0;x<11;x++)positions.push((x-5)*spacing+.15,(y*.17)+.35,(z-3.5)*spacing);const fluid=new physics.PBFFluid({positions:new Float32Array(positions),particleRadius:.065,smoothingRadius:.29,bounds:{min:[-1,-.1,-.85],max:[1.3,1.5,.85]},iterations:4,gravity:[0,-3.2,0]});
  const surface=new MarchingCubes(28,materials.water,true,true,100000);surface.position.fromArray(config.position||[1.7,1.5,0]);surface.scale.fromArray(config.scale||[1.55,1.55,1.55]);surface.isolation=36;surface.castShadow=true;content.add(surface);pickables.push(surface);surface.userData.elementRoot=container;const world=new physics.PhysicsWorld({fixedDt:1/90,maxSubsteps:5});world.add(fluid);state.simulation={kind:'pbf',fluid,world,surface};animated.push({type:'custom',update:dt=>{if(dt>0)world.step(dt);surface.reset();for(let i=0;i<fluid.count*3;i+=3){surface.addBall(fluid.positions[i]/3.1+.5,fluid.positions[i+1]/3.1+.5,fluid.positions[i+2]/3.1+.5,.045,10);}surface.update();}});container.userData.impulse=(p,strength)=>{const q=surface.worldToLocal(p.clone()).multiplyScalar(3.1/2);fluid.addImpulse(q.toArray(),1.8,[strength*1.4,strength*3,.5]);};}catch(e){console.warn('Fluid reconstruction unavailable',e);}}

function buildTransitionSpecimen(id){const n=+id.slice(1),root=new THREE.Group();root.position.set(1.8,2,0);content.add(root);const parts=[];for(let i=0;i<(n===9||n===10?5:n===16||n===17?14:3);i++){const g=createElement(n===7||n===8?'E16':n===15?'F06':i===0?'C01':'A08',materials);root.add(g);g.scale.setScalar(i===0?1:.35);parts.push(g);g.traverse(o=>{if(o.isMesh){o.castShadow=true;pickables.push(o);o.userData.elementRoot=root;}});}
  const poses=parts.map((g,i)=>{g.position.set((i-(parts.length-1)/2)*.7,0,i*.04);if(parts.length>8)g.scale.setScalar(.14);return {position:g.position.clone(),rotation:g.rotation.clone(),scale:g.scale.clone()};});
  transitionSystem=new TransitionSystem({scene:content,camera,eventBus:bus});transitionId=id;let started=false;
  const run=()=>{if(transitionHandle?.status==='running')transitionSystem.cancel(transitionHandle);parts.forEach((g,i)=>{g.position.copy(poses[i].position);g.rotation.copy(poses[i].rotation);g.scale.copy(poses[i].scale);});const opts={object:root,objects:parts,duration:3.4};if(id==='L18'){opts.object=camera;opts.to=[5,2.5,6];opts.lookAt=[1.8,2,0];}transitionHandle=transitionSystem.play(id,opts);started=true;};root.userData.impulse=run;animated.push({type:'custom',update:()=>{if(!started&&!cameraTween)run();}});return root;
}

function buildComposition(index=0){const recipe=compositions[index];if(!recipe){buildWorld();toast('Composition catalogue not available.');return;}clearContent();state.mode='composition';updateModeUI();const assembly=new THREE.Group();assembly.name=recipe.name||recipe.title||recipe.id;content.add(assembly);
  for(const part of recipe.parts||[]){try{const g=addElement(part.element||part.elementId||part.id,[0,0,0],1,[0,0,0],{material:part.material});if(part.dimensions){const size=new THREE.Box3().setFromObject(g).getSize(new THREE.Vector3());g.scale.multiply(new THREE.Vector3(...part.dimensions.map((d,i)=>d/Math.max(size.getComponent(i),.01))));}if(part.scale){if(Array.isArray(part.scale))g.scale.multiply(new THREE.Vector3(...part.scale));else g.scale.multiplyScalar(part.scale);}g.position.fromArray(part.position||[0,0,0]);g.rotation.fromArray(part.rotation||[0,0,0]);assembly.attach(g);g.userData.motionController.initialPosition.copy(g.position);g.userData.partId=part.id;}catch(e){console.warn('Composition part',part,e);}}
  assembly.position.set(1.8,1.8,0);selectedObject=assembly;$('#scene-title').textContent=assembly.name;$('#scene-subtitle').textContent='Text-free components. One shared material language.';$('#selected-code').textContent=`ASSEMBLY / ${recipe.id||index+1}`;$('#selected-name').textContent=assembly.name;$('#selected-description').textContent=recipe.description||'Reusable spatial assembly. Content frames and semantic application bindings are declared in the composition recipe.';$('#material-label').textContent='SPATIAL COMPOSITION';frameObject(assembly);
}

function buildCatalogue(){const families=[...new Set(catalogue.map(e=>e.familyCode||e.family))];$('#element-count').textContent=catalogue.length;$('#families').innerHTML='';for(const f of ['all',...families]){const b=document.createElement('button');b.textContent=f==='all'?'All':fallbackNames[f]||f;b.dataset.family=f;b.classList.toggle('active',f===state.family);b.addEventListener('click',()=>{state.family=f;$('#families').querySelectorAll('button').forEach(x=>x.classList.toggle('active',x===b));buildList();});$('#families').append(b);}buildList();}
function buildList(){const q=state.search.toLowerCase(),items=catalogue.filter(e=>(state.family==='all'||(e.familyCode||e.family)===state.family)&&`${e.id} ${e.name} ${e.familyName} ${e.description}`.toLowerCase().includes(q));$('#elements').replaceChildren();$('#list-count').textContent=items.length;$('#list-label').textContent=state.family==='all'?'ALL ELEMENTS':(fallbackNames[state.family]||state.family).toUpperCase();for(const e of items){const b=document.createElement('button');b.className='element'+(state.selected===e.id&&state.mode==='specimen'?' active':'');b.dataset.family=e.id[0];b.dataset.id=e.id;b.setAttribute('role','listitem');const sw=document.createElement('span');sw.className='swatch';const label=document.createElement('span');label.className='element-name';label.textContent=e.name;const code=document.createElement('span');code.className='element-code';code.textContent=`${e.id} / ${e.familyName||fallbackNames[e.id[0]]}`;label.append(code);b.append(sw,label);b.addEventListener('click',()=>selectElement(e.id));$('#elements').append(b);}}
function buildCompositions(){const s=$('#composition');for(let i=0;i<compositions.length;i++){const o=document.createElement('option');o.value=i;o.textContent=compositions[i].name||compositions[i].title||compositions[i].id;s.append(o);}}
function updateModeUI(){document.body.classList.toggle('specimen',state.mode!=='world');document.querySelectorAll('[data-mode]').forEach(b=>b.classList.toggle('active',b.dataset.mode===state.mode));$('#composition-picker').hidden=state.mode!=='composition';}
function setMode(mode){if(mode==='world')buildWorld();else if(mode==='composition')buildComposition(+$('#composition').value||0);else selectElement(state.selected);}
function setTheme(theme){state.theme=theme;const old=materials;materials=createMaterials(theme);scene.background.set(palette[theme][0]);scene.fog.color.set(palette[theme][0]);buildEnvironment();setMode(state.mode);Object.values(old).forEach(m=>m.dispose?.());return theme;}

function bindUI(){
  $('#seed-demo').addEventListener('click',()=>{if(state.mode!=='world')buildWorld();state.seedStart=state.time;toast('Contact → internal glow → lift → orbit → settle');});
  $('#search').addEventListener('input',e=>{state.search=e.target.value;buildList();});document.querySelectorAll('[data-mode]').forEach(b=>b.addEventListener('click',()=>setMode(b.dataset.mode)));$('#composition').addEventListener('change',e=>buildComposition(+e.target.value));
  $('#theme').addEventListener('change',e=>setTheme(e.target.value));$('#quality').addEventListener('change',e=>{state.quality=e.target.value;renderer.setPixelRatio(state.quality==='ultra'?2:state.quality==='native'?1:Math.min(devicePixelRatio||1,1.5));resize();toast(state.quality==='ultra'?'Ultra rendering · 2× supersampling':'Render quality updated');});$('#motion').addEventListener('change',e=>{state.motion=e.target.checked;});$('#bloom').addEventListener('change',e=>{state.bloom=e.target.checked;bloomPass.enabled=state.bloom;});$('#autorotate').addEventListener('change',e=>controls.autoRotate=e.target.checked);
  for(const [id,direction] of [['camera-front',[0,.06,1]],['camera-three',[.55,.3,1]],['camera-side',[1,.12,.02]],['camera-top',[.01,1,.01]]]){$('#'+id).addEventListener('click',()=>{const d=camera.position.distanceTo(controls.target);frameScene({position:controls.target.clone().add(new THREE.Vector3(...direction).normalize().multiplyScalar(d)).toArray(),target:controls.target.toArray()});$('.controls-row').querySelectorAll('button').forEach(b=>b.classList.toggle('active',b.id===id));});}
  $('#reset').addEventListener('click',()=>{motions.forEach(m=>m.reset());if(state.mode==='world')frameScene({position:[8,5.4,13.3],target:[2.8,2.1,0]});else frameObject(selectedObject);toast('Camera and interaction reset');});$('#screenshot').addEventListener('click',exportPNG);$('#export-glb').addEventListener('click',exportGLB);$('#toggle-library').addEventListener('click',()=>{if(innerWidth<=720)document.body.classList.toggle('mobile-library');else document.body.classList.toggle('panel-hidden');});
  window.addEventListener('keydown',e=>{if(e.target.matches('input,select'))return;if(e.key==='Escape')releasePointer();if(e.key===' '){e.preventDefault();$('#motion').checked=state.motion=!state.motion;}if(['ArrowLeft','ArrowRight','ArrowUp','ArrowDown'].includes(e.key)){const m=selectedObject?.userData.motionController;if(m){e.preventDefault();m.setValue(m.value.target+((e.key==='ArrowRight'||e.key==='ArrowUp')?.05:-.05));}}});window.addEventListener('blur',releasePointer);document.addEventListener('visibilitychange',()=>{if(document.hidden)releasePointer();});
}

function pointerRay(e){const rect=renderer.domElement.getBoundingClientRect();pointer.set((e.clientX-rect.left)/rect.width*2-1,-(e.clientY-rect.top)/rect.height*2+1);raycaster.setFromCamera(pointer,camera);}
function bindPointer(){const canvas=renderer.domElement;
  canvas.addEventListener('pointerdown',e=>{if(e.button!==0||state.drag)return;pointerRay(e);const hits=raycaster.intersectObjects(pickables,false);if(!hits.length)return;const hit=hits[0],root=hit.object.userData.elementRoot;if(!root)return;const normal=camera.getWorldDirection(new THREE.Vector3()),plane=new THREE.Plane().setFromNormalAndCoplanarPoint(normal,hit.point);state.drag={id:e.pointerId,root,plane,point:hit.point.clone(),startPoint:hit.point.clone(),lastX:e.clientX,lastY:e.clientY};controls.enabled=false;cameraTween=null;canvas.setPointerCapture(e.pointerId);root.userData.motionController?.begin(hit.point,hit.object);root.userData.grab?.(hit.point);root.userData.impulse?.(hit.point,1.2);bus.emit('touch',hit.point,1);$('#interaction-state').textContent='CONTACT / ACTIVE';canvas.style.cursor='grabbing';e.stopImmediatePropagation();},true);
  canvas.addEventListener('pointermove',e=>{pointerRay(e);if(state.drag?.id===e.pointerId){const p=new THREE.Vector3();if(!raycaster.ray.intersectPlane(state.drag.plane,p))return;const rect=canvas.getBoundingClientRect(),delta={x:(e.clientX-state.drag.lastX)/rect.width,y:(e.clientY-state.drag.lastY)/rect.height};state.drag.root.userData.motionController?.drag(p,delta);if(state.drag.root.userData.moveGrab){const deltaPosition=p.clone().sub(state.drag.startPoint);deltaPosition.clampLength(0,.85);p.copy(state.drag.startPoint).add(deltaPosition);state.drag.root.userData.moveGrab(p);}state.drag.lastX=e.clientX;state.drag.lastY=e.clientY;state.drag.point.copy(p);e.stopImmediatePropagation();}else{canvas.style.cursor=raycaster.intersectObjects(pickables,false).length?'grab':'default';}},true);
  canvas.addEventListener('pointerup',releasePointer,true);canvas.addEventListener('pointercancel',releasePointer,true);canvas.addEventListener('lostpointercapture',releasePointer,true);
}
function releasePointer(){if(!state.drag)return;const d=state.drag;state.drag=null;d.root.userData.motionController?.release();d.root.userData.releaseGrab?.();if(renderer.domElement.hasPointerCapture(d.id))renderer.domElement.releasePointerCapture(d.id);controls.enabled=true;renderer.domElement.style.cursor='default';$('#interaction-state').textContent='RELEASE / SETTLING';bus.emit('release',d.point,.5);}

function resize(){const rect=$('#viewport').getBoundingClientRect();if(!rect.width||!rect.height)return;camera.aspect=rect.width/rect.height;camera.updateProjectionMatrix();renderer.setSize(rect.width,rect.height,false);composer.setSize(rect.width,rect.height);}
function loop(){const dt=Math.min(clock.getDelta(),.04);renderFrame(dt);}
function renderFrame(dt){reflectionSerial++;if(state.motion)state.time+=dt;const simdt=state.motion?dt:0;
  if(cameraTween){cameraTween.time+=dt;const t=clamp(cameraTween.time/1.1,0,1),s=t*t*(3-2*t);camera.position.lerpVectors(cameraTween.start,cameraTween.end,s);controls.target.lerpVectors(cameraTween.from,cameraTween.to,s);if(t===1)cameraTween=null;}
  updateMaterials(materials,state.time,{point:new THREE.Vector3(),strength:0,velocity:new THREE.Vector3()});for(const m of motions)m.update(simdt,state.time);for(const a of animated){if(a.type==='float'){a.object.position.y=a.home.y+Math.sin(state.time*.65+a.phase)*.13;a.object.rotation.y=Math.sin(state.time*.25+a.phase)*.12;}else if(a.type==='custom')a.update(simdt);}
  if(environment)environment.children.forEach(o=>{if(o.userData.home){const h=o.userData.home,i=o.userData.phase;o.position.set(h.x+Math.sin(state.time*.18+i)*.25,h.y+Math.sin(state.time*.33+i)*.17,h.z+Math.cos(state.time*.21+i)*.24);}});
  if(water&&state.motion){const pos=water.geometry.attributes.position,a=pos.array,r=water.userData.rest;for(let i=0;i<a.length;i+=3){const x=r[i],z=r[i+2];a[i+1]=Math.sin(x*.48+state.time*.5)*.029+Math.cos(z*.61+state.time*.35)*.024+Math.sin((x+z)*1.4+state.time*.7)*.011;for(const impulse of waterImpulses){const t=state.time-impulse.start,d=Math.hypot(x-impulse.x,z-impulse.z),front=d-t*1.6;if(t<8)a[i+1]+=Math.cos(front*7)*Math.exp(-front*front*1.3)*Math.exp(-t*.65)*.075*impulse.strength;}}pos.needsUpdate=true;if(frameCount%3===0)water.geometry.computeVertexNormals();}
  if(caustics&&frameCount%3===0)caustics.update(state.time);transitionSystem?.update(simdt);if(!(transitionId==='L18'&&transitionHandle?.status==='running'))controls.update();composer.render();frameCount++;fpsClock+=dt;if(fpsClock>.8){state.fps=Math.round(frameCount/fpsClock);$('#performance').textContent=`${state.fps} FPS / LIVE 3D`;$('#stats').textContent=`${Math.round(renderer.info.render.triangles/1000)}K TRIANGLES / PERSPECTIVE`;frameCount=0;fpsClock=0;}
}

function download(blob,name){const a=document.createElement('a'),url=URL.createObjectURL(blob);a.href=url;a.download=name;a.click();setTimeout(()=>URL.revokeObjectURL(url),5000);}
function exportPNG(){composer.render();renderer.domElement.toBlob(blob=>{if(blob){download(blob,`opaline-${state.mode}-${state.selected}-${state.theme}.png`);toast('PNG image exported');}},'image/png');}
async function exportGLB(){if(!selectedObject)return;const saved=[];try{
  // Interaction controllers contain back references. Export only portable authoring metadata.
  selectedObject.traverse(o=>{saved.push([o,o.userData]);o.userData={id:o.userData.elementId||o.userData.id,role:o.userData.role};});
  const copy=selectedObject.clone(true);for(const [o,data] of saved)o.userData=data;saved.length=0;copy.position.set(0,0,0);
  copy.traverse(o=>{if(!o.isMesh)return;const source=o.material;const m=new THREE.MeshPhysicalMaterial({color:source.color||0xbddacb,roughness:source.roughness??.18,transmission:source.transmission??.7,thickness:source.thickness??.5,ior:source.ior??1.42,metalness:source.metalness||0,clearcoat:source.clearcoat||0,side:source.side});if(source.emissive)m.emissive.copy(source.emissive);m.emissiveIntensity=source.emissiveIntensity||0;o.material=m;});
  const data=await new GLTFExporter().parseAsync(copy,{binary:true,onlyVisible:true});download(new Blob([data],{type:'model/gltf-binary'}),`opaline-${state.selected}-${state.theme}.glb`);copy.traverse(o=>{if(o.isMesh)o.material.dispose();});toast('GLB exported · motion remains in the runtime library');
}catch(e){for(const [o,data] of saved)o.userData=data;console.error(e);toast('GLB export failed. Source geometry remains available.');}}


init().catch(fail);
